    _startingLine: '[Ask about Jeanne]'
    _dialogue:
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: A fresh tragedy, poor Jeanne. The star of my theatre.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: 'I have seen many actors try to perform on my stage. '
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: No noble-born had her skills. Certainly not the one my darling has invited
        today.
    - _saidByPlayer: 0
      _line: Tis odd, my daughter feels the loss heavily despite having no interest
        in the stage.
    _oneTimeOnly: 0
